       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             SPMAUDIT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PM-AUDIT
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM4601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PM-AUDIT
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  PM-AUDIT-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4601.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  BASE                PIC X(24)  VALUE "  MMISA;".
       77  FILE-STATUS         PIC X(02).

           COPY TBLOWUP        IN COPYLIB.

           COPY DBSTAT         IN COPYLIB.

           COPY VCOMLINK       IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  PM-AUDIT-DATA.
           COPY DPMAUDIT       IN COPYLIB.

       01  DBPARAMETERS.
           COPY DBPARMS        IN COPYLIB.

       01  ERROR-MESSAGE.
           05  ERROR-TEXT      PIC X(70).
           05  ERROR-FILL      PIC X(06).
           05  ERROR-CODE      REDEFINES ERROR-FILL PIC 9(06).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING PM-AUDIT-DATA
                               DBPARAMETERS
                               ERROR-MESSAGE.

       START-PROCESSING.
           OPEN I-O            PM-AUDIT.
           MOVE SPACES         TO ERROR-MESSAGE.

           WRITE PM-AUDIT-REC  FROM PM-AUDIT-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "WRITE ERROR - RECORD NOT ADDED TO AUDIT-TRAIL"
                               TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

           GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               PM-AUDIT.
           GOBACK.

       999-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "SPMAUDIT"     TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP"      USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
                               VIEW-COMAREA FILE-STATUS
                               BU-DISPLAY-MSG BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

      *******************  END OF PROGRAM  -  SPMAUDIT  *****************
